WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Captain, how are you doing?

2
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:04,440
Just been warned

3
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:06,120
What happened to that player?

4
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:08,280
Why are high-level ghosts so close to him?

5
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:09,800
You can't tell the difference between the big and the small kings

6
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:12,400
The ghost society needs to show this attitude to its subordinates

7
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:14,280
Can you guess a mentally ill person?

8
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:16,240
Why do we need to obtain the consent of the copy BOSS?

9
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:18,320
Can you tell me the news about benefits?

10
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:20,000
Haven't you ever been to work?

11
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:22,360
Discussing salary is generally prohibited in the company

12
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:24,700
Benefits by level

13
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,420
Talking about it can easily cause psychological imbalance among employees.

14
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:30,420
Welfare benefits should be informed by personnel but other than him

15
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:31,780
none of us were informed

16
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:34,760
It seems to be intentional as long as we don't mention it

17
00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:35,960
They just pretended to forget

18
00:00:36,360 --> 00:00:37,560
After dinner, go find personnel quickly

19
00:00:40,370 --> 00:00:42,530
Do you have the company rules? Can you give me a copy?

20
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:44,660
Are you asking me for it?

21
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:46,940
I specially picked the ghost with only two sections.

22
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:48,380
Even if the other party reports

23
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:50,380
I can also control it completely

24
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:55,320
I'll give it to you when I get back to the office

25
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:57,350
It's actually possible to get it

26
00:00:59,390 --> 00:01:00,310
BOSS, stop clicking.

27
00:01:00,470 --> 00:01:01,430
Order after you finish eating

28
00:01:01,550 --> 00:01:02,790
There is one highlight left
